WEBVTT

00:01:28.963 --> 00:01:31.508
high stakes, low stakes and no stakes.

00:01:31.532 --> 00:01:33.348
Let's start with no-stakes decisions.

00:01:33.372 --> 00:01:35.108
These are the minor details of life,

00:01:35.132 --> 00:01:37.438
where there is almost
never an incorrect answer,

00:01:37.462 --> 00:01:39.496
and in a few hours,
you won't even remember

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:40.678
making the decision.

00:01:40.702 --> 00:01:43.368
A good example of this is
choosing what to watch on TV.

00:01:43.392 --> 00:01:46.028
With thousands of shows,
it's easy to get overwhelmed,

00:01:46.052 --> 00:01:47.386
yet no matter what you pick,

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:50.098
the consequences
are basically nonexistent.

00:01:50.122 --> 00:01:52.448
So spending more
than a few moments on FOBO

00:01:52.472 --> 00:01:54.488
is a massive waste of energy.

00:01:54.512 --> 00:01:55.788
You just need to move on.

00:01:55.812 --> 00:01:57.574
When it comes to no-stakes decisions,

00:01:57.598 --> 00:02:00.268
the key is to outsource them
to the universe.